  "prefLabel": "Odb 202.04 Sitting member",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 202.04 “Sitting member” means an individual who has been appointed to the board and to whom the oath of office has been administered, and includes any member whose term has expired until such time as a replacement is appointed. The term does not include any member who has resigned from the board, regardless of whether a replacement has been appointed.\n\nSource. #12941, eff 12-15-19",
